<li>Tipe 90 HE AA pointed Complete round: 8.94&amp;nbsp;kg, projectile: 6.52&amp;nbsp;kg with Type 89 AA fuse.</li>
</ul>
<li>Peledak Berkekuatan Tinggi</li>
<ul>
<li>Tipe 90 HE pointed Complete round: 8.55&amp;nbsp;kg, projectile: 6.35 with Type 88 impact or Type 88 delay.</li>
</ul>
